    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Description/Metric Definitions'>
      <repository-location derived-from='http://ip-172-31-0-77:8504/t/Foodora/workbooks/APCompDashWithVerticalSplit/DescriptionMetricDefinitions?rev=' id='DescriptionMetricDefinitions' path='/t/Foodora/workbooks/APCompDashWithVerticalSplit' revision='' site='Foodora' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='1400' maxwidth='1400' minheight='1400' minwidth='1400' preset-index='17' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11286' id='5' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='571'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='14'>APAC Competition Dashboard</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#b8209d' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='14714' id='6' type-v2='text' w='71286' x='571' y='11857'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>About</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• The dashboard provides an overview on key metrics for foodpanda vs key competitors in APAC</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• The dashboard refreshes </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>every Thursday EOD</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'> and covers data up to 5 days before e.g dashboard will be refreshed on 11 July, covering data up till 7 July</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• There might be occasional delay in the refresh due to data issue and bug fixes</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Market Intelligence</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• We welcome competition-related market intelligence to help us improve the data insights</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• If you have any that you would like to share, you can submit them via the Google form: </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4996b2' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeT_wT8gRWatP4n1ju_NxGgBfapy24FpDu6I3li2yjTjCeClg/viewform&amp;quot;'>https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeT_wT8gRWatP4n1ju_NxGgBfapy24FpDu6I3li2yjTjCeClg/viewform</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='49715' id='7' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='49714'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Data Source</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• foodpanda: internal data from Pandata </run>
              <run fontcolor='#e01e5a' fontname='Monaco,Menlo,Consolas,Courier New,monospace'>fulfillment-dwh-production.pandata_report.regional_apac_mkt_incentive_cost</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• competitor: samples of transactional data obtained from external data provider</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Methodology</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• To approximate competitor&apos;s actual market share, statistical methods are used to extrapolate raw data</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• For a more comprehensive explanation, please read the documentaion: </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4996b2' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://confluence.deliveryhero.com/display/ADM/APAC+Competition+Dashboard&amp;quot;'>https://confluence.deliveryhero.com/display/ADM/APAC+Competition+Dashboard</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Definition</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• Customer: number of unique customers who made successful orders on the platform</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• Order: number of successful unique orders made on the platform</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• GMV: net gross merchandise value</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• Incentive: discount and promotion applied to an order</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• Incentive share: % of incentivised order</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• icpgmv: incentive spend/gross gmv</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• icpigmv: incentive spend/incentivised gross gmv</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• icpo: incentive spend per order</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• AFV: average food value</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• DF: delivery fee</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• Transacted DF: (Sum of DF paid) / (Number of unique orders with Transacted DF &gt; 0)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• Subscriber: number of unique customers who subscribe to either PandaPro (foodpanda) and GrabUnlimited (GrabFood)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Questions</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• For questions on dashboard, please refer to FAQ section in documentation: </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4996b2' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://confluence.deliveryhero.com/display/ADM/APAC+Competition+Dashboard&amp;quot;'>https://confluence.deliveryhero.com/display/ADM/APAC+Competition+Dashboard</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• For questions on dashboard, please reach out to </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;mailto:sakthi.ganesh@foodpanda.com&amp;quot;'>sakthi.ganesh@foodpanda.com</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'> or </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4996b2' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;mailto:xiaufong.low@foodpanda.com&amp;quot;'>xiaufong.low@foodpanda.com</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'> (Competition Strategy team)</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='18643' id='9' is-centered='0' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Read Me.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='98858' x='571' y='31071'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4500' id='195' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='26571'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Data Coverage</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>• The below table shows metrics available for each competitor across the markets</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='14714' id='196' type-v2='empty' w='27572' x='71857' y='11857'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='9143' id='120' type-v2='text' w='41143' x='56286' y='1643'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='10'>The access to this dashboard is </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='10'>restricted </run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='10'>as it contains confidential information. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='10'>Please apply for &quot;tableau-pandora Competition Strategy Foodpanda APAC&quot; role in Sailpoint and access will be given on a case-by-case basis.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='10'>Reach out to </run>
            <run fontcolor='#4996b2' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='10' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;mailto:sakthi.ganesh@foodpanda.com&amp;quot;'>sakthi.ganesh@foodpanda.com</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Slack-Lato' fontsize='10'> for further information or questions.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
