                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>The access to this dashboard is </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>restricted</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>as it contains confidential information.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>Please apply for &quot;tableau-pandora Competition Strategy Foodpanda APAC&quot; role in Sailpoint and access will be given on a case-by-case basis. </run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>Reach out to sakthi.ganesh@foodpanda.com for further information or questions.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
